# Unicode CLDR 47, locale cy, gregorian calendar (cldr-json
# cldr-dates-full/main/cy/ca-gregorian.json).
# The wide name is the head noun "dydd" (day) plus the day's own name.
# "dydd" is the target of soft mutation after the markers that open an
# adverbial "on <weekday>" ("ar ddydd Llun", "bob ddydd Sul"), so the
# mutated head is listed beside the radical; attested in running text on
# cy.wikipedia.org ("ar ddydd Llun", "o ddydd Llun i ddydd Sadwrn").
# Soft-mutated surfaces are listed beside the radical: Welsh changes a
# word's first letter after a preceding trigger, so a matcher that saw
# only the radical would miss the form running text actually carries.
# Mutation table: en.wikipedia.org, "Welsh mutation".
dydd mercher
ddydd mercher
